@host = http://localhost:5017
@transactionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@anaId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### ===== Contas =====

### Listar contas — paginado (padrão page=1, pageSize=10; máx. 100)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts?page=1&pageSize=10

### Resumo das contas (quantidades e saldos por moeda, todas as contas)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/summary

### Entradas/saídas liquidadas por dia (fuso de Brasília)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/{{anaId}}/cash-flow?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-07&utcOffsetMinutes=-180

### Consultar conta
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/{{anaId}}

### Consultar saldo
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/{{anaId}}/balance

### Criar conta fictícia
POST {{host}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "99887",
  "holderName": "Fernanda Lima",
  "initialBalance": 1500.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "isActive": true
}

### ===== Transações =====

### Listar transações — paginado, filtros opcionais (status separados por vírgula, conta origem/destino)
GET {{host}}/api/transactions?page=1&pageSize=10&status=Pending,Processing&accountNumber=12345

### Contagem por status (todas as transações)
GET {{host}}/api/transactions/summary

### Transferir R$ 500 de Ana para Bruno (Worker processa em seguida)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccount": "12345",
  "destinationAccount": "67890",
  "amount": 500.00
}

### Falha: saldo insuficiente (Bruno tem R$ 250)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccount": "67890", "destinationAccount": "12345", "amount": 5000 }

### Falha: moedas incompatíveis (BRL -> USD)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccount": "12345", "destinationAccount": "11223", "amount": 10 }

### Falha: conta de destino inativa
POST {{host}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccount": "12345", "destinationAccount": "44556", "amount": 10 }

### Listar transações
GET {{host}}/api/transactions

### Consultar por ID
GET {{host}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}

### Consultar status
GET {{host}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}/status

### Solicitar cancelamento (somente Pending)
PATCH {{host}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}/cancel
